---
title: "Wiring Map — Three Loops That Make It Alive"
scope: global
---
flowchart TD
    %% === THE MAIN SPINE ===

    SOURCES["**DATA SOURCES**<br/>Working Memory · Hippocampus · Cerebellum<br/>PNS · Project Context · World Model<br/>Task Graph · Homeostasis"]

    SOURCES ==>|"all 8 sources"| THAL

    THAL{{"**THALAMUS**<br/>central relay<br/>assembles per-consumer briefings"}}

    THAL ==>|"consultation · motor<br/>evaluation · inhibition<br/>scheduling"| CONSUMERS

    CONSUMERS["**CONSUMERS**<br/>Senses · Motor Cortex · Evaluators<br/>Inhibitor · Scheduler"]

    CONSUMERS ==>|"consult → build → evaluate"| RESULTS(("**Results**"))

    %% === LOOP 1 FEEDBACK: back to top ===
    RESULTS -.->|"① scores → WM<br/>accuracy → Cerebellum<br/>efference copy → Thalamus<br/>suppressed senses → WM"| SOURCES

    %% === LOOP 2: EXECUTIVE ===
    SOURCES -->|"direct reads<br/>(bypass Thalamus)"| PFC

    PFC["**PFC — executive**<br/>Conviction · Drift Monitor · Planner<br/>Prospective Prep · NE · Cog Flexibility"]

    PFC -.->|"② manifested future<br/>forward briefing<br/>NE modulation"| THAL
    PFC -.->|"NE modulates<br/>Inhibitor + Eval strategy"| CONSUMERS

    %% === LOOP 3: LEARNING ===
    RESULTS ==>|"Cerebellum compares<br/>predicted vs actual"| SUBCORT

    SUBCORT["**SUBCORTICAL — learning**<br/>Dopamine → BG · Plasticity · Tonic<br/>encoding strength → Hippocampus"]

    SUBCORT -.->|"③ updated episodes<br/>routine weights<br/>sense weights"| SOURCES

    %% === STYLES ===
    style SOURCES fill:#e8e0f0,stroke:#7c6af0,color:#1a1a2e
